:: ```cmd
:: SetupComplete.cmd
@echo off
:: Block automatic driver updates
reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\DriverSearching" /v=
 SearchOrderConfig /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f

:: Set Windows Update to manual mode (notify before download/install)
